# Purpose: Find unique client addresses associated with HTTP 503 responses in a pipe-delimited access log.
# Inputs: access.log uses timestamp|method|client|path|status columns.
# Outputs: stdout lists unique affected client addresses in sorted order.
accept access_path as text with default "access.log"
run cat with path access_path
pipe to grep with flags ["-E"] and pattern "[|]503$"
pipe to cut with delimiter "|" and fields "3"
pipe to sort
pipe to uniq
